      "type": "goal",
      "title": "Lesson Goals",
      "items": [
        "Master the famous Spanish phonological rule: le/les changes to 'se' before lo/la/los/las.",
        "Form sentences like 'se lo di', 'se la mandé', and 'se los expliqué'."
